=head1 DESCRIPTION

Options for enabling and configuring fine-grained access control. For
more information, see Fine-grained access control in Amazon OpenSearch
Service
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/opensearch-service/latest/developerguide/fgac.html).

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 AnonymousAuthEnabled => Bool

True to enable a 30-day migration period during which administrators
can create role mappings. Only necessary when enabling fine-grained
access control on an existing domain
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/opensearch-service/latest/developerguide/fgac.html#fgac-enabling-existing).


=head2 Enabled => Bool

True to enable fine-grained access control.


=head2 InternalUserDatabaseEnabled => Bool

True to enable the internal user database.


=head2 JWTOptions => L<Paws::OpenSearch::JWTOptionsInput>

Container for information about the JWT configuration of the Amazon
OpenSearch Service.


=head2 MasterUserOptions => L<Paws::OpenSearch::MasterUserOptions>

Container for information about the master user.


=head2 SAMLOptions => L<Paws::OpenSearch::SAMLOptionsInput>

Container for information about the SAML configuration for OpenSearch
Dashboards.



